e":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../../index/type-aliases/Row.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Row"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"columnid","children":[{"type":"text","value":"columnId"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const firstName = row_getValue(row, 'firstName')","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"function-row-getvalue","text":"Function: row_getValue()","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"row","text":"row","level":3},{"id":"columnid","text":"columnId","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Function: row\\_getValue()\n\n```ts\nfunction row_getValue<TFeatures, TData>(row, columnId): unknown;\n```\n\nDefined in: [core/rows/coreRowsFeature.utils.ts:78](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/core/rows/coreRowsFeature.utils.ts#L78)\n\nReads and caches this row's value for a column.\n\nThe value is produced by the column accessor. Missing columns or display\ncolumns without an accessor return `undefined`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../../index/interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../../index/type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### row\n\n[`Row`](../../index/type-aliases/Row.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n### columnId\n\n`string`\n\n## Returns\n\n`unknown`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst firstName = row_getValue(row, 'firstName')\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: row_getValue\ntitle: row_getValue\n---\n\n# Function: row\\_getValue()\n\n```ts\nfunction row_getValue<TFeatures, TData>(row, columnId): unknown;\n```\n\nDefined in: [core/rows/coreRowsFeature.utils.ts:78](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/core/rows/coreRowsFeature.utils.ts#L78)\n\nReads and caches this row's value for a column.\n\nThe value is produced by the column accessor. Missing columns or display\ncolumns without an accessor return `undefined`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../../index/interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../../index/type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### row\n\n[`Row`](../../index/type-aliases/Row.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n### columnId\n\n`string`\n\n## Returns\n\n`unknown`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst firstName = row_getValue(row, 'firstName')\n```\n"}
